<title>SWEDEN: Average yield in Swedish five-yr bond 5.71 pct.</title>
<headline>Average yield in Swedish five-yr bond 5.71 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of two billion crowns of Sweden's new five-year bond -- issued for the first time -- was 5.71 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1039</p>
<p> Volume issued (millions)		 1,997</p>
<p> Total bids    (millions)		 5,243</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		     14</p>
<p> Number of bids				  62</p>
<p> Lowest yields (pct)			5.680</p>
<p> Highest yields			     5.710</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		   5.706</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
